{
  "description": "Glance wakes (#10, emulator src/core/glance.ts, firmware core/glance.cpp). snapshotDiff: region key -> hash maps (prev null = no valid snapshot in RTC), ignore = clock regions; result sorted. glanceStep: what a wake does with its result. wifiFast: how to reconnect from the RTC Wi-Fi cache. liveNow: live mode after a key press. arm: first-boot safety, ARM_BOOTS = 3 confirmed boots with network per firmware version (stored = null: none; ops count = this boot confirmed). tally (#178): wake counters since power-on in RTC memory, ops in order from zero: [\"wake\", sleptAtEpoch, wakeAtEpoch, nowEpoch] (slept = clock when known and not backwards, else planned timer, else 0), [\"glance\", ok, redraw, wifiMs|null, haMs|null, totalMs], [\"sleep\", awakeMs, fullRefreshes, partialRefreshes].",
